    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_53">
      <bpmn:text>* Roles inferred from tasks. People are observed. 5 business events have no actor.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_55">
      <bpmn:text>Loops and order flexibility are observed; their business cause and timing are unknown.</bpmn:text>
